:: Deadwood Robin Private Invite
<<set _site to $RobinExpansion.intimacy_site>>
<<set _return to _site is 'shop' ? (Time.hour lt 21 ? 'Deadwood Robin Shop' : 'Cliff Street')
  : _site is 'lemonade' ? 'Beach'
  : _site is 'chocolate' ? 'Park'
  : _site is 'swim' or _site is 'fishing' ? 'Beach'
  : $RobinExpansion.meteor_return>>
<<set $outside to ['meteor', 'swim', 'fishing'].includes(_site) ? 1 : 0>>
<<set $location to _site is 'shop' ? 'deadwood_robin_shop' : _site is 'chocolate' ? 'park' : 'beach'>>
<<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if !['shop', 'lemonade', 'chocolate', 'meteor', 'swim', 'fishing'].includes(_site)
  or !isLoveInterest('Robin') or C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 50
  or $robinmissing or $robin.timer.hurt gt 0
  or $RobinExpansion.asylum.status is 'admitted'
  or (['swim', 'fishing'].includes(_site) and getRobinLocation() isnot 'beach')>>
  <<set $RobinExpansion.intimacy_site to null>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Robin cannot spend time with you now.' '罗宾现在没法陪你。'>>
<<else>>
  <<switch _site>>
    <<case 'shop'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The temporary staff take the till. Robin slips into the stockroom with you and pulls the door almost shut, then freezes at the sound of a customer at the counter.
          <<if maplebirch.get('Robin').canTease>>
            "You do pick your moments," <<he>> whispers, and reaches for you anyway.
          <<else>>
            <<He>> keeps <<his>> hand on the door. "Not here. Not with them right outside." <<he>> needs a moment before <<he>> can meet your eyes again.
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          临时店员接过收银台，罗宾和你一起溜进储藏室，轻轻掩上门，却在柜台传来客人声音时僵住。
          <<if maplebirch.get('Robin').canTease>>
            “你挑的时机可真好。”<<he>>低声说，还是伸手拉住了你。
          <<else>>
            <<his>>手仍按在门上。“不要在这里。他们就隔着一道门。”<<he>>缓了一会儿，才敢重新看向你。
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
    <<case 'lemonade'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You duck beneath the lemonade cart while Robin is serving. The canvas hides you from the queue, and Robin's bare legs are right there beneath <<his>> apron.
          <<if maplebirch.get('Robin').canTease>>
            <<He>> looks down, startled, and hisses, "There are people here—" Then <<he>> sees where your face has stopped, and <<his>> hands tighten on the cart until the wood creaks. "…Don't stop on my account. Just. Be quiet." <<He>> waits for your answer, thighs trembling slightly.
          <<else>>
            Robin looks down, startled, and clutches the apron tight against <<his>> knees. "W-wait, what are you doing?" <<he>> whispers in a frantic blush. "There are people in line right outside! Please... not here."
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾忙着招呼客人，你悄悄钻到柠檬水车下。帆布挡住排队的人，而罗宾光裸的双腿就在你眼前，在围裙下摆微晃。
          <<if maplebirch.get('Robin').canTease>>
            罗宾低头看见你，吃了一惊，压着嗓子说了句“这里有人——”，随即发现你的脸停在哪里，攥着车把的手指猛地收紧，木架被捏得发响。“……别、别管我。就是……别出声。”<<He>>等你回答，双腿已经有些紧绷发颤。
          <<else>>
            罗宾低头看见你，吓得脸颊通红，急忙按住膝前的围裙。“等、等等，你在干什么呀？”<<he>>压低声音慌张地说，“外面还有客人在排队呢！求你了……别在这儿。”
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
    <<case 'chocolate'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You crouch beneath the cocoa stand while Robin stirs the next cup. The counter conceals you from the path.
          <<if maplebirch.get('Robin').canTease>>
            Robin glances down and whispers, "Someone might come over." <<He>> waits for your answer, eyes darting between the counter and you.
          <<else>>
            Robin glances down and startles, nearly dropping the ladle. "Someone might come over!" <<he>> whispers with a bright blush. "Please come out before anyone sees you."
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾正在搅动下一杯可可，你在摊位下面蹲下。柜台挡住小路上的视线。
          <<if maplebirch.get('Robin').canTease>>
            罗宾低头看了你一眼，轻声说：“随时会有客人过来。”<<He>>在柜台与你之间游移着目光，等你回答。
          <<else>>
            罗宾低头看见你，手一抖差点把勺子掉进锅里。“随时会有客人过来的！”<<he>>满面通红地低语，“快先出来吧，被人看见就糟了。”
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
    <<case 'meteor'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Another meteor crosses the sky. Robin draws the blanket around you
          both, then pauses. "Would you like to stay here with me?" <<he>> asks.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          又一颗流星划过夜空。罗宾把毯子拉到你们身上，随后停下来。
          “你想和我在这里多待一会儿吗？”<<he>>轻声问。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'swim'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin swims beside you towards the rocks. You stop where your feet can reach the sand. "Stay here a while?" <<he>> asks, taking your hand and waiting for your answer.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你们并肩游到礁石旁，在脚能够碰到沙的地方停下。“在这儿多待一会儿？”罗宾牵起你的手，等你回答。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'fishing'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The rod goes back in its sleeve. Robin takes the long way along the tideline instead of the path, where the rocks stand between you and the stall. <<He>> stops when you stop. "We still have time before I'm needed," <<he>> says, watching your face rather than the water.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          鱼竿收回套子里。罗宾没走小路，而是沿着潮线绕远，走到礁石把你们和摊位隔开的那一侧。你停下，<<he>>也停下。“离我该回去还有一会儿，”<<he>>说，看的是你的脸，不是海面。
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
  <br><br>
  <<if !['meteor', 'swim', 'fishing'].includes(_site) and !maplebirch.get('Robin').canTease>>
    <span class='teal'><<lanSwitch 'Robin would rather return to work.' '罗宾想先回去工作。'>></span>
  <<elseif _site is 'lemonade' or _site is 'chocolate'>>
    <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink ['Continue beneath the stall', '在摊位下继续'] 'Deadwood Robin Private Sex'>>
      <<set $sexstart to 1>>
    <</lanLink>><<promiscuous4>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink ['Kiss Robin', '吻罗宾'] 'Deadwood Robin Private Sex'>>
      <<set $sexstart to 1>>
    <</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Robin' 'kiss'>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Go back for now', '先回去'] _return>>
  <<set $RobinExpansion.intimacy_site to null>><<endevent>>
<</lanLink>>

